  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "Given equation: 7 × 3 - 98 ÷ 14 + 5 = 31\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) 5 and 3**\n\nGiven: 7 × 3 - 98 ÷ 14 + 5 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 7 × 5 - __**98 ÷ 14**__ + 3 = 31\n\n⇒ __**7 × 5**__ - 7 + 3 = 31\n\n⇒ __**3**____**5**__ - 7 __**+ 3**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __38____** - 7**__ = 31\n\n⇒** 31 = 31**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) 31 and 7\n\nGiven: 7 × 3 - 98 ÷ 14 + 5 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 31 × 3 - __**98 ÷ 14**__ + 5 = 7\n\n⇒ __**31 × 3**__ - 7 + 5 = 7\n\n⇒ __**9**____**3**__ - 7 __**+ 5**__ = 7\n\n⇒ __98 -____ 7__ = 7\n\n⇒ 91 ≠ 7\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 3 and 14\n\nGiven: 7 × 3 - 98 ÷ 14 + 5 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 7 × 14 - __**98 ÷ 3**__ + 5 = 31\n\n⇒ __**7 × 14**__ - 32.66 + 5 = 31\n\n⇒ __**98**__ - 32.66 __**+ 5**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __103** - 32.66**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 70.34 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 7 and 98\n\nGiven: 7 × 3 - 98 ÷ 14 + 5 = 31\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 98 × 3 - __**7 ÷ 14**__ + 5 = 31\n\n⇒ __**98 × 3**__ - 0.5 + 5 = 31\n\n⇒ __**2**____**94**__ - 0.5 __**+ 5**__ = 31\n\n⇒ __2____99** - 0.5**__ = 31\n\n⇒ 298.5 ≠ 31\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
